    "shortDescription": "Cotton Coverall IFR Boiler Suit is a premium flame-resistant protective garment designed to ensure maximum safety in environments exposed to heat, flame, and electrical arc hazards. \u2022 Turn down collar \u2022 Front closure flame retardant metal zipper \u2022 2 chest pockets and 2 back pockets closed with FR snap buttons \u2022 Stitched with FR threads ensuring durability \u2022 Bar tack at all stress points adding strength \u2022 Elastic waist band with action back adding flexibity and comfort \u2022 Adjustable sleeve with FR snap buttons \u2022 Flame retardant UL certified 50mm silver reflective tapes on sleeve and legs Cotton Coverall IFR Boiler Suit made from Inherently Flame-Resistant (IFR) fabric , it offers permanent protection without compromising on comfort or durability. The coverall features a full front zipper closure , multiple utility pockets , and elasticated cuffs for a secure fit. Lightweight and breathable , it is ideal for use in oil & gas, electrical, welding, and industrial maintenance sectors. The IFR Coverall C complies with major international safety standards for fire-resistant clothing.",
