        "value": "The Parapet Anchor Device Hi-PRPT-01 is a compact, adjustable anchorage solution designed for use on structural parapets during temporary work at heights. \u2022 Portable, Light weight anchorage point designed for parapet to ensure safe working in suspended position (E.g. Facade cleaning) \u2022 Material: Galvanized steel, strong and built to last \u2022 Rubber padding supports the working surface and reduces the possibility of damage \u2022 Adjustability: between 75 mm to 390 mm \u2022 Weight: 8 kg approximately \u2022 Maximum Breaking strength : 35 kN \u2022 Standards: EN 795 Class B. Parapet Anchor Device Hi-Prpt-01 Engineered for strength and reliability, this anchor provides a secure attachment point for personal fall arrest systems without damaging building surfaces. Constructed from high-grade steel with corrosion-resistant coating, the Hi-PRPT-01 is easy to install, remove, and adjust to fit various parapet thicknesses. Ideal for maintenance, inspection, and fa\u00e7ade work, it ensures user safety while complying with relevant safety standards."
