    "shortDescription": "Stainless Steel 200 Kg Udyogi UB 2011 the Rope Grab Fall Arrester System consists of an openable Rope Grab Device, made up to high strength Galvanized steel. which moves freely along the polyamide twisted rope anchorage line (14mm to 16mm), Attached at its eye with the user, while he moves up and down. The Rope Grab immediately \u2018grabs\u2019 on the line in the event of a fall, thereby arresting the fall . Stainless Steel 200 Kg Udyogi UB 2011 is a high-strength anchorage device designed to provide reliable fall protection support in vertical lifeline systems. Constructed from premium stainless steel , it offers excellent durability and corrosion resistance, ensuring long-term performance in harsh or outdoor environments. With a load capacity of up to 200 kg, this anchorage system is ideal for heavy-duty industrial use, including construction, maintenance, and tower operations.",
