    "shortDescription": "Lithium Ion Fire Extinguisher Singapore is the only Singapore Fire Code Approved fire extinguisher that can put out lithium battery fires \u2022 Fire Armour is proud to present the Hercules Lithium Ex Fire Extinguisher. \u2022 Each Hercules Lithium Ex Fire Extinguisher has an incredibly long discharge time. \u2022 Upon discharge, the fire fighting agent is very gently applied over the fire as a very fine mist, \u2022 cooling the fire and encapsulating the battery to stop thermal runaway. \u2022 Very importantly, the agent is easy to clean up after a fire occurs as compared to traditional powder fire extinguishers . \u2022 The agent itself does not conduct electricity , making it suitable for use on electrical equipment. \u2022 Different capacities are available for different sizes of batteries. \u2022 Certified to EN3 standards, this fire extinguisher has been rigorously tested in Europe. As there are no standard fire tests available for lithium battery fires, this fire extinguisher is instead tested to EN3 Class A fires. This also allows it to double up as a standard Class A Lithium Ion Fire Extinguisher .",
