    "shortDescription": "The Scanner is a high performance Hand Held Metal Detector designed to meet the exact requirements of the security industry. This new generation detector is intended for access control , for intensive use on the periphery of a secure area (bars, nightclubs, cinemas, theaters, schools, companies, embassies, airports, railway stations, etc.). Typical uses will includes body search for offensive weapons in crowd control, airport and border security, checking parcels and letters for metal objects and anywhere that hidden metal needs to be detected . Design for user comfort and detection efficiency: slim and elongated shape of the specially designed sensing area. Very simple operation without prior setting. A sensitivity button allows you to choose between High and Low Sensitivity. The Detector is automatically in High Sensitivity mode. To switch to the low sensitivity mode to detect only larger objects like weapons and to avoid anything that will be smaller like keys, you have to keep your finger pressed on this sensitivity button. Equipped with a Hand strap on the handle for a secure holding. Supplied with a holster for belt with snap closure. Powered by a 9V Alkaline Battery (not supplied) 40 hours of work.",
